1
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,640
Beat the hell out of him!

2
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,799
Stop hitting him!

3
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,400
Stop it!

4
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,280
Where did you get this piglet?

5
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:36,079
Are you giving him to me as muscle?

6
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,480
What do you mean?

7
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,159
You dare steal someone Snake wants?

8
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,560
Just kidding.

9
00:01:45,359 --> 00:01:46,599
Wait for my command.

10
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,040
Don't do anything rash.

11
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,599
Old Gu

12
00:02:16,199 --> 00:02:17,759
really knows how to pick them.

13
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,439
This face,

14
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,159
this body...

15
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,199
Exactly my type.

16
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,759
Is Snake in?

17
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,879
Snake is waiting inside.

18
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:26,240
Babe.

19
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,400
You're here.

20
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,120
This piece of trash...

21
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:31,039
I told him to call his uncle back home

22
00:03:31,039 --> 00:03:32,159
and ask for 500,000.

23
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:34,800
He dragged his feet and tipped off the cops.

24
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:37,439
There goes my 500,000.

25
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:40,879
I'll give you one last chance.

26
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,479
If you don't get through this time,

27
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,439
I'll rip every tooth out of your mouth,

28
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:46,080
one by one.

29
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,360
Get lost!

30
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:47,960
Move!

31
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,039
Old Gu.

32
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:01,840
Is this

33
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:04,360
the genius programmer you mentioned?

34
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,520
That's right. He's very capable.

35
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,919
Snake.

36
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:10,759
Give me a shot.

37
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,039
I want to make money.

38
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,279
Come on.

39
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,519
We call this high-paying employment.

40
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,120
Didn't Old Gu tell you?

41
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,079
He did.

42
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:50,399
I'm here, Snake.

43
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,000
What's up, Snake?

44
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,120
I lost half a million today.

45
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:09,000
Find a big fish and have the newbie try it out.

46
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,360
If it works out,

47
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,160
get me that half a million back.

48
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,319
No problem.

49
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:16,920
Take him somewhere else.

50
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,800
If he's one of us, he stays.

51
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,079
If he's a cop...

52
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,040
Let's go.

53
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,839
Anyone who fails to meet their quota...

54
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:34,879
You will all

55
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:36,439
end up like him.

56
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,360
Get back to work!

57
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,000
Don't move!

58
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,199
Keep your head up.

59
00:06:05,199 --> 00:06:06,160
Against the wall!

60
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,600
And to think I treated you as an old classmate.

61
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,759
I can't believe you set me up like this.

62
00:06:08,839 --> 00:06:09,959
If you don't hit your quota again,

63
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:11,319
believe me, I'll break your legs.

64
00:06:11,319 --> 00:06:12,639
You'd better think long and hard.

65
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,279
If you don't start behaving,

66
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,720
I'll sell you off overseas.

67
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,399
No, please!

68
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,800
Have you seen enough?

69
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,519
Let's go.

70
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:28,160
Move it, move it!

71
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,120
Snap to it!

72
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,199
Get on those phones!

73
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:31,199
Hit those keyboards!

74
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,279
This is our Money Laundering Dept. and Call Center.

75
00:06:41,279 --> 00:06:42,199
Work hard.

76
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:43,240
Keep it up!

77
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,600
Move it.

78
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,759
Is all this really necessary?

79
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,639
I'm exhausted from all this hassle.

80
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:19,920
Cut the crap.

81
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,199
Just do as you're told.

82
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:26,199
Fine, if there's nothing else, I'm out of here.

83
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,959
Not so fast, old man.

84
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,920
We can't do this job without you.

85
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:35,920
Lin Xiaoxian, 35 years old.

86
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,839
Single.

87
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,040
Paralyzed from the waist down.

88
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,600
Wait, what is this supposed to mean?

89
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,959
You know my bottom line.

90
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:43,759
I don't touch the old, weak, sick, disabled, or pregnant.

91
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:44,600
Bottom line?

92
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,199
You're talking to me about a bottom line?

93
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,959
You've done your fair share of dirty work.

94
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:50,240
Bottom lines are meant to be crossed.

95
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,199
Let me tell you,

96
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,240
Snake ordered this.

97
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,600
Should I ask Snake to talk to you?

98
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,800
But look at her.

99
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,519
She doesn't even look like she has money.

100
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:02,160
And Snake wants over half a million.

101
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,639
You don't know shit.

102
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,920
Women in their thirties to fifties,

103
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,600
who are older, unmarried only daughters...

104
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:08,079
...have the fattest wallets.

105
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,199
Got it?

106
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:10,560
Kid.

107
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:11,920
You want to make money, right?

108
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,439
If we pull this job off today,

109
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,800
and get off to a good start,

110
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:16,360
I'll have you making money in no time.

111
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,000
Don't worry, Brother Liu.

112
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,839
How did you know I'm Liu?

113
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:31,279
I guessed.

114
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,200
Doesn't your earring have a "six" on it?

115
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,919
So I figured you must be Brother Liu.

116
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:36,799
Right?

117
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,120
You're quite observant.

118
00:08:42,039 --> 00:08:43,360
But being a smooth talker won't help you.

119
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,919
You're a senior programmer, right?

120
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,320
Let's see how "senior" you really are.

121
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,759
If you dare play any tricks...

122
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,759
I wouldn't dare.

123
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,120
Don't worry, Brother Liu.

124
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,799
I promise to behave.

125
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,039
We're not scamming money.

126
00:08:57,399 --> 00:08:58,440
We call it helping these fools...

127
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,080
...redistribute their wealth.

128
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,080
Understand?

129
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,440
Yes, yes, I get it.

130
00:09:04,919 --> 00:09:05,840
Create a virtual account.

131
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:06,960
Memorize this.

132
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:07,840
Get to work.

133
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:08,840
You got it.

134
00:10:03,759 --> 00:10:05,399
Hello?

135
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,519
Hello, Ms. Lin.

136
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:07,840
I'm from the Communications Administration.

137
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,440
I have an important matter to inform you of.

138
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,600
What is it?

139
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,360
Ms. Lin, your personal information has been registered by scammers

140
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,399
to commit online fraud.

141
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,000
Fraud?

142
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,799
Ma'am, please don't panic.

143
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,799
Let me verify your personal information.

144
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,559
Lin Xiaoxian.

145
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,000
Female.

146
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,639
35 years old, unmarried.

147
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:27,399
Your ID number ends in 673X, right?

148
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,559
Yes.

149
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,399
That's my personal information.

150
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:34,159
Your phone and social media accounts,

151
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,440
all your accounts,

152
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,399
will be deactivated before 6:00 PM today.

153
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:38,480
Deactivated?

154
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,360
You can't deactivate them!

155
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:42,440
I finally scraped together the money for my surgery.

156
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,080
My accounts cannot be deactivated.

157
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,080
Ma'am, scammers used your personal information

158
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,679
to commit crimes remotely in Yanzhou City.

159
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:50,240
You need to go to Yanzhou City immediately today

160
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,360
to make a statement.

161
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,279
I'm over 1,000 kilometers away from there.

162
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:54,639
I can't get there right now.

163
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,440
Why don't I just call the police now?

164
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,879
Ma'am, please don't panic.

165
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,480
I can transfer you to the local police in Yanzhou City

166
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,320
to make an online statement

167
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,320
and see what they say.

168
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:04,159
Oh, okay.

169
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:05,080
Thank you.

170
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,399
Hello, Ms. Lin.

171
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,919
We are the Yanzhou City police.

172
00:11:25,919 --> 00:11:27,000
Please cooperate with the investigation.

173
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,679
How should I cooperate with the investigation?

174
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:32,039
I will send a link to your phone.

175
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,279
This is our official police video app.

176
00:11:34,799 --> 00:11:35,799
Once you've downloaded it,

177
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:36,919
follow the instructions to open it.

178
00:11:37,279 --> 00:11:38,279
Then we'll take your statement.

179
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,720
You'll understand everything after that.

180
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,519
Okay.

181
00:11:41,519 --> 00:11:42,720
I've downloaded it.

182
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,799
Um, Officer?

183
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,919
Can I see you first?

184
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:49,080
Just to verify.

185
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:51,120
Of course, this is a necessary procedure.

186
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:53,080
I commend your security awareness.

187
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,200
Ms. Lin,

188
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,759
please accept my video call invitation now.

189
00:12:07,799 --> 00:12:08,720
Hello, Ms. Lin.

190
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,720
This is my police badge.

191
00:12:09,919 --> 00:12:10,759
Please verify it.

192
00:12:11,279 --> 00:12:12,960
Next, I will ask you some questions,

193
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,080
and you must answer them truthfully.

194
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,240
Sweetie,

195
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,919
who are you on a video call with?

196
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,080
It's nothing, Dad.

197
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,320
You go buy groceries first.

198
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:22,519
Alright then.

199
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:29,240
Officer?

200
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,279
Ms. Lin,

201
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,679
the entire questioning must be conducted alone.

202
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,639
According to regulations,

203
00:12:33,799 --> 00:12:34,840
this statement is now invalid.

204
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,480
We will freeze your accounts according to the law.

205
00:12:36,879 --> 00:12:39,639
Afterward, you must come to Yanzhou City for an in-person statement.

206
00:12:39,799 --> 00:12:41,039
Officer, please don't be angry.

207
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:41,840
Officer!

208
00:12:42,639 --> 00:12:44,600
Could you please give me another chance?

209
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,120
My accounts really can't be frozen.

210
00:12:46,879 --> 00:12:47,919
I'm begging you.

211
00:12:48,879 --> 00:12:50,480
Your situation is very complicated.

212
00:12:50,879 --> 00:12:51,840
I need to consult my superior.

213
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,080
Ms. Lin has a physical disability,

214
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,559
so traveling is very inconvenient for her.

215
00:12:59,639 --> 00:13:02,320
She's asking if there's any way we can help her.

216
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,519
Ms. Lin,

217
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,720
your situation is quite complicated.

218
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:11,399
We just received an arrest warrant for you.

219
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:14,720
It will be issued nationwide shortly.

220
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,919
Is it that serious?

221
00:13:18,279 --> 00:13:20,120
I haven't done anything wrong!

222
00:13:20,799 --> 00:13:22,879
You won't send me to jail, will you?

223
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,039
Don't be nervous.

224
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:26,879
The case is still under investigation.

225
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,720
We won't wrongly accuse a good person,

226
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,200
nor will we let a bad person go.

227
00:13:30,639 --> 00:13:33,399
However, your case involves many people

228
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,440
and a massive amount of money.

229
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,600
Of course, considering your actual circumstances,

230
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,919
we will give you a chance to prove your innocence.

231
00:13:41,159 --> 00:13:41,600
Thank you.

232
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,480
Thank you, sir.

233
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:48,480
Ms. Lin, please provide your bank account numbers.

234
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:52,559
I've already sent the bank card details over.

235
00:13:52,799 --> 00:13:54,399
Okay, we will begin our analysis.

236
00:14:19,559 --> 00:14:20,279
Xiao Chen.

237
00:14:20,279 --> 00:14:23,200
We've confirmed these funds are clean.

238
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:24,639
Understood. Thank you.

239
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:25,960
Ms. Lin.

240
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:28,759
You must now transfer the funds

241
00:14:28,759 --> 00:14:29,559
from your other bank accounts as well.

242
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:30,480
Please rest assured.

243
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,799
We will verify the source of the funds as soon as possible.

244
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,759
Once verified,

245
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:35,399
your money will be returned to the original accounts.

246
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:37,600
But, sir...

247
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,399
this money is for my dad's surgery.

248
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:41,639
Could you please...

249
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:42,600
If you hesitate any longer,

250
00:14:42,639 --> 00:14:44,000
you'll very likely go to jail.

251
00:14:44,039 --> 00:14:44,960
Do you understand?

252
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:45,879
I understand.

253
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:57,440
Babe.

254
00:14:58,240 --> 00:15:01,519
Your live-stream team is really doing great.

255
00:15:02,399 --> 00:15:04,799
The boss is very happy with you.

256
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,559
Thanks to Snake looking out for me.

257
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,200
I've already transferred the money.

258
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,960
Ma'am, we are verifying your funds.

259
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,519
We'll have the results soon.

260
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:26,919
You need to go to the designated location and wait for two hours.

261
00:15:27,399 --> 00:15:29,320
You can go home once the arrest operation is over.

262
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:30,440
Okay, I understand.

263
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,519
Thank you, sir.

264
00:15:31,519 --> 00:15:32,360
Thank you.

265
00:15:32,519 --> 00:15:33,360
Thank you all.

266
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,879
Brother Liu.

267
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:38,159
Look at the computer. Hurry.

268
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,679
You're really something.

269
00:15:44,679 --> 00:15:45,919
A big fish.

270
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:46,919
What's going on?

271
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,080
Snake.

272
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,519
We got it.

273
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,639
Five hundred thousand.

274
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,000
Not bad.

275
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:58,360
Liu, split up the money, quick.

276
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,559
Have the mules withdraw the cash.

277
00:15:59,559 --> 00:16:00,559
Okay, I'll get on it.

278
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,519
Within ten minutes,

279
00:16:07,519 --> 00:16:09,679
I want all the money withdrawn.

280
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,240
Move out!

281
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:13,399
Go, go, go!

282
00:16:55,559 --> 00:16:57,320
Who are you? What do you want?

283
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:59,000
We just graduated from college.

284
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:01,240
I heard you're hiring for high-paying jobs,

285
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:02,799
so I brought my girlfriend over.

286
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:03,960
How did you find this place?

287
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,400
It's in the middle of nowhere.

288
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:06,440
Did someone refer you?

289
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,480
Yes.

290
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,000
My cousin, Chen Lianxin.

291
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,480
He's overseas.

292
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:12,240
He told us to come here for some experience first,

293
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:13,359
before going to his place.

294
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:15,440
Brother Gou, I think there is such a guy.

295
00:17:15,519 --> 00:17:17,960
Brother, we've been walking mountain roads all day.

296
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,200
We haven't eaten a thing.

297
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:20,839
Please just take us in.

298
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,359
Come in.

299
00:17:26,039 --> 00:17:27,319
Police! Keep quiet!

300
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:28,880
Hurry!

301
00:17:38,839 --> 00:17:39,720
Police!

302
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,920
Run! Run!

303
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,680
Smash it!

304
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,720
Brother Liu, what happened?

305
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:01,799
Cops!

306
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:02,480
Shit!

307
00:18:11,319 --> 00:18:12,200
Don't follow me.

308
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:13,319
Every man for himself.

309
00:18:20,039 --> 00:18:21,039
You guys, go over there.

310
00:18:34,559 --> 00:18:35,359
Stop!

311
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,319
Brother Liu.

312
00:18:44,519 --> 00:18:45,519
Hurry up, Brother Liu.

313
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,640
Freeze. Don't move.

314
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:06,960
Put your hands up.

315
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,240
Li Wen.

316
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,759
I treated you like a brother.

317
00:20:00,359 --> 00:20:01,440
Why did you break the law?

318
00:20:04,039 --> 00:20:05,279
You tell me.
